# World façade, ported from upstream b2World in world.h plus the world and
# lifecycle API family in box2d.h. This is the first usable, non-solving
# public world API: bodies, shapes, chains, mass maintenance, proxy
# synchronisation, transforms, and overlap/ray/shape-cast queries.
#
# Storage follows upstream: bodies live in solver sets (static, disabled,
# awake, and per-body sleeping sets in Stage 6), with dense BodySim and
# BodyState records in parallel scalar arrays per decision 0004. Body,
# Shape, and Chain are sparse façade arrays; destruction frees the slot and
# bumps the generation, so stale façades fail IsValid and raise on use.
#
# Contact, joint, island, and stepping machinery arrives from Stage 7; the
# world reports itself as unlocked until then and World.Step throws.
Class World Inherits BroadPhasePairSink
## Gravity vector (metres per second squared).
Property Gravity As Vector2
## Restitution velocities below this threshold are zeroed (metres per second).
Property RestitutionThreshold As Double
## Relative velocity above which hit events are emitted (metres per second).
Property HitEventThreshold As Double
## Maximum contact push-out velocity (metres per second).
Property MaxContactPushSpeed As Double
## Contact stiffness in hertz.
Property ContactHertz As Double
## Contact damping ratio.
Property ContactDampingRatio As Double
## Maximum linear velocity of any body (metres per second).
Property MaximumLinearSpeed As Double
## Whether bodies may sleep.
Property EnableSleeping As Boolean
## Whether continuous collision detection is enabled.
Property ContinuousEnabled As Boolean
## Whether warm starting is enabled. Solver-relevant from Stage 7.
Property WarmStartingEnabled As Boolean
## Whether speculative contact margins are enabled. Solver-relevant from
## Stage 7.
Property SpeculativeEnabled As Boolean
## Whether the world refuses mutation, set during Step from Stage 7.
Property Locked As Boolean
## User data owned by the application.
Property UserData As Integer
## The broad phase owning the three proxy trees.
Property BroadPhase As BroadPhase
## Sparse body façade store indexed by body slot.
Property Bodies As Array(Of Body)
## Sparse shape façade store indexed by shape slot.
Property Shapes As Array(Of Shape)
## Sparse chain façade store indexed by chain slot.
Property Chains As Array(Of Chain)
## Per-slot generation counters, bumped when a slot is freed so that reused
## slots never reuse a generation.
Property BodyGenerations As IntegerList
## Per-slot generation counters for shape slots.
Property ShapeGenerations As IntegerList
## Per-slot generation counters for chain slots.
Property ChainGenerations As IntegerList
## Contact slot pool.
Property ContactIdPool As IdPool
## Sparse contact record store indexed by contact slot.
Property Contacts As Array(Of Contact)

## Recycled contact records. Destroyed contacts keep their record here so
## steady-state pair churn in moving scenes allocates nothing after
## capacity warm-up. Internal solver bookkeeping; applications do not
## touch this list.
Property ContactPool As Array(Of Contact)
## Number of live contacts.
Property ContactCount As Integer
## Optional custom contact filter. When Nothing (the default) the broad
## phase applies only the built-in shape and body rules and the hook adds
## no overhead.
Property CustomFilter As CustomContactFilter
## Island slot pool.
Property IslandIdPool As IdPool
## Sparse island record store indexed by island slot.
Property Islands As Array(Of Island)
## Island selected for splitting during the step. NULL_INDEX when none.
Property SplitIslandId As Integer
## Constraint graph holding the touching contacts in twelve colours.
Property ConstraintGraph As ConstraintGraph
## Solver sets. Index 0 static, 1 disabled, 2 awake, 3+ sleeping.
Property SolverSets As Array(Of SolverSet)
## Body slot pool.
Property BodyIdPool As IdPool
## Shape slot pool.
Property ShapeIdPool As IdPool
## Chain slot pool.
Property ChainIdPool As IdPool
## Solver-set slot pool for sleeping sets.
Property SolverSetIdPool As IdPool
## Joint slot pool.
Property JointIdPool As IdPool
## Number of live joints, ported from b2World_GetJointCount.
Property JointCount As Integer
## Persistent joint records, indexed by joint slot.
Property Joints As Array(Of Joint)
## Generation per joint slot, surviving record replacement.
Property JointGenerations As IntegerList
## Cached inverse substep length from the last step, used by the joint
## force accessors. Zero before the first step.
Property InvH As Double

## Reused overlap query adapter.
Private Property mOverlapContext As WorldOverlapContext
## Reused ray cast query adapter.
Private Property mRayCastContext As WorldRayCastContext
## Reused shape cast query adapter.
Private Property mShapeCastContext As WorldShapeCastContext
## Reused local ray cast input for shape casts.
Private Property mLocalRayInput As RayCastInput
## Reused local shape cast input for shape casts.
Private Property mLocalCastInput As ShapeCastInput
## Reused local proxy for shape casts.
Private Property mLocalProxy As ShapeProxy
## Reused scratch point for local space conversions.
Private Property mLocalPoint As Vector2

# Warm-path scratch records owned by the world. Reused across body and
# shape creation so a warm rebuild after World.Clear allocates only the
# recreated Body and Shape facade objects and their owned state.
## Scratch mass record reused by warm-path mass updates.
Private Property mMassScratch As MassData
## Scratch extent record reused by warm-path extent updates.
Private Property mExtentScratch As ShapeExtent
## Scratch transform reused by warm-path transform reads.
Private Property mTransformScratch As Transform

## Second scratch transform so the narrow phase reads two bodies without
## allocating.
Private Property mTransformScratchB As Transform

## Scratch bounds for the continuous-collision sweep union, reused across
## steps so fast-body advances allocate nothing.
Private Property mContinuousBoxScratch As AABB

## Second continuous-collision scratch holding the swept shape's end
## bounds while the union reads the stored start bounds.
Private Property mContinuousBoxScratchB As AABB
## Scratch vector reused by warm-path mass and extent updates.
Private Property mVectorScratch As Vector2
## Scratch per-step solver values reused across steps.
Private Property mStepScratch As StepContext

## Recycled solver sets. Destroyed per-island sleeping sets keep their
## retained buffer capacity here and are reused by the next sleep cycle so
## warmed sleep/wake transitions allocate nothing.
Private Property mSolverSetPool As Array(Of SolverSet)

## Scratch list reused by island splitting. Island splitting runs whenever
## a contact or joint is removed from an awake island, so this list is
## world-owned and cleared per use. Internal solver bookkeeping.
## Scratch list reused by island splitting. Island splitting runs whenever
## a contact or joint is removed from an awake island, so this list is
## world-owned and cleared per use. Internal solver bookkeeping.
Property SplitBodyIdsScratch As Array(Of Integer)

## DFS stack for island splitting, paired with SplitBodyIdsScratch.
## Internal solver bookkeeping.
Property SplitStackScratch As Array(Of Integer)
## Opt-in pre-solve manifold editor consulted during the narrow phase.
Property PreSolve As CustomPreSolve
## Opt-in material mixer consulted when contacts compute friction and
## restitution.
Property MaterialMixer As CustomMaterialMixer
## Scratch bit set marking contacts whose touching state changed this step.
Private Property mContactStateBits As BitSet
## Scratch bit set marking islands that still hold a body below the sleep
## threshold.
Private Property mAwakeIslandBits As BitSet
## Scratch bit set marking awake body sims whose shapes enlarged their
## AABBs this step.
Private Property mEnlargedBodyBits As BitSet

# Stage 8 event storage. The columns are deliberately public so the
# WorldEvents view can read them; treat them as internal state and never
