## Sensor store, one record per live sensor shape.
Property Sensors As Array(Of Sensor)
## End-event buffer being filled during the current step.
Property EndEventWriteIndex As Integer
## End-event buffer readable after the current step completes.
Property ReadableEndIndex As Integer
## Sensor begin event sensor shape slots.
Property SensorBeginSensorIds As IntegerList
## Sensor begin event sensor shape generations.
Property SensorBeginSensorGens As IntegerList
## Sensor begin event visitor shape slots.
Property SensorBeginVisitorIds As IntegerList
## Sensor begin event visitor shape generations.
Property SensorBeginVisitorGens As IntegerList
## Per-buffer sensor end event sensor shape slots.
Property SensorEndSensorIds As Array(Of IntegerList)
## Per-buffer sensor end event sensor shape generations.
Property SensorEndSensorGens As Array(Of IntegerList)
## Per-buffer sensor end event visitor shape slots.
Property SensorEndVisitorIds As Array(Of IntegerList)
## Per-buffer sensor end event visitor shape generations.
Property SensorEndVisitorGens As Array(Of IntegerList)
