Property ContactEndShapeAIds As Array(Of IntegerList)
## Per-buffer contact end event first shape generations.
Property ContactEndShapeAGens As Array(Of IntegerList)
## Per-buffer contact end event second shape slots.
Property ContactEndShapeBIds As Array(Of IntegerList)
## Per-buffer contact end event second shape generations.
Property ContactEndShapeBGens As Array(Of IntegerList)
